                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "This is an annotation used on an object property to indicate a logical characterstic beyond what is possible in OWL." ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "OBO Operations call" ;
                                             <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432> ;
