                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "x expressed in y if and only if there is a gene expression process (GO:0010467) that occurs in y, and one of the following holds: (i) x is a gene, and x is transcribed into a transcript as part of the gene expression process (ii) x is a transcript, and the transcription of x is part of the gene expression process (iii) x is a mature gene product such as a protein, and x was translated or otherwise processes from a transcript that was transcribed as part of this gene expression process" ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165> ;
