                                                                     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002578>
                                                                   ) ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "p regulates q iff p is causally upstream of q, the execution of p is not constant and varies according to specific conditions, and p influences the rate or magnitude of execution of q due to an effect either on some enabler of q or some enabler of a part of q." ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7476-6306> ,
