                                                                     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002212>
                                                                   ) ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "p negatively regulates q iff p regulates q, and p decreases the rate or magnitude of execution of q." ;
