                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A broad relationship between an exposure event or process and a process by which the exposure stressor comes into contact with the exposure receptor" ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "ExO:0000055" ;
