                                                                     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002630>
                                                                     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002333>
                                                                   ) ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> """The entity A, immediately upstream of the entity B, has an activity that negatively regulates an activity performed by B. 
For example, A and B may be gene products and binding of B by A negatively regulates the kinase activity of B.""" ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165> ,
