                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "A mass measurement assay measures an material's mass characteristic. A radioactivity detection assay measures the amount of radiation (alpha, beta or gamma ray emmissions) coming from a material."@en ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A relation between an assay and a characteristic, in which the assay generates a data item which is a measure of a characteristic."@en ;
                                            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165> ;
                                            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2023-05-23T15:24:15Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
                                            rdfs:label "assay measures characteristic"@en .


