                                            rdfs:domain <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000001> ;
                                            rdfs:range <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000001> ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "q1 different_in_magnitude_relative_to q2 if and only if magnitude(q1) NOT =~ magnitude(q2). Here, magnitude(q) is a function that maps a quality to a unit-invariant scale." ;
