                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "A high number of tumor cells expressing the nuclear protein Ki-67 is prognostic_for an aggressive cancer." ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A relationship between a biomarker 'b' and a disease or condition of clinical interest 'd', where the presence or occurrence of 'b' is used to infer the likelihood of a clinical event, disease recurrence or progression in patients who have 'd'." ;
