                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An immune response mediated by cells expressing specific receptors for antigens produced through a somatic diversification process, and allowing for an enhanced secondary response to subsequent exposures to the same antigen (immunological memory)." ;
