                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Catalysis of the reaction: a 2'-deoxyribonucleoside 5'-triphosphate + DNA(n) = diphosphate + DNA(n+1); RNA-template-directed extension of the 3'-end of a DNA strand by one deoxynucleotide at a time." ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000412> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/go.owl> ;
                                            rdfs:label "RNA-directed DNA polymerase activity" .


