                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "regulation of blood pressure" ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Any process that modulates the force with which blood travels through the circulatory system. The process is controlled by a balance of processes that increase pressure and decrease pressure." ;
