                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "response to stimulus" ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Any process that results in a change in state or activity of a cell or an organism (in terms of movement, secretion, enzyme production, gene expression, etc.) as a result of a stimulus. The process begins with detection of the stimulus and ends with a change in state or activity or the cell or organism." ;
