###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032326
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032326> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                            rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032260> ,
                                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_1280> ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Infection with staphylococcus aureus resistant to the antibiotic methicillin (MRSA). MRSA can infect any individual but is more common among hospitalized patients, and can also occur as an opportunistic infection." ;
