                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A report figure is a report display element that has some aspect of illustration, but may be a composite of figures, images, and other elements"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "I prepended the 'report ' to make it clear that we mean parts of reports here. We may want a more generic version of 'figure', in which case this would become a defined class - figure and part_of some report"@en ,
                                                                                          "Replaced by defined version of figure"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "person:Alan Ruttenberg"@en ,
