                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Verspoor, K., Cohen, KB., Hunter, L. Textual characteristics of traditional and Open Access scientific journals are similar, BMC Bioinformatics 2009, 10:183."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A textual entity intended to identify a particular publication."@en ;
