###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000202
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000202> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023>
