                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A gas filter function is a filter function which prevents the flow of solid objects, defined by specific qualities, in a gas-solid mixture"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Frank Gibson" ;
                                             rdfs:label "gas filter function"@en .


