                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A liquid chromatography device that mixes different solvents, e.g. under high pressure and in differrent volumes ranging from 5 ml to 5 L capacity. Powerful magnetic mixers provide vigorous agitation required for high pressure reaction chemistry."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Daniel Schober" ;
