                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "injecting a mouse with PBS solution, weighing it, and recording the weight according to a study design." ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "a planned process that carries out a study design"@en ;
