                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Designed to perform capillary LC with injection of sample volumes ranging from nL to L."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Daniel Schober" ;
