                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> """Harmonisation of multi-centre real-time reverse-transcribed PCR results of a candidate prognostic marker in breast cancer: an EU-FP6 supported study of members of the EORTC - PathoBiology Group.

Span PN, Sieuwerts AM, Heuvel JJ, Spyratos F, Duffy MJ, Eppenberger-Castori S, Vacher S, O'Brien K, McKiernan E, Pierce A, Vuaroqueaux V, Foekens JA, Sweep FC, Martens JW.
Eur J Cancer. 2009 Jan;45(1):74-81. PMID: 19008094""" ;
