                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A gas chromatography oven is an oven with a heated connection between the GC and the MS instrument in a GCMS-analysis, that keeps compounds in the gas phase as they leave the GC oven."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Daniel Schober" ;
