                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "The measurement of T cell proliferation as a response to a viral peptide by culturing T cells stimulated with APCs and peptide in the presence of tritiated thymidine, and using a scintillation counter to detect the radioactivity." ;
