###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000671
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000671> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001479>
