                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "a recombination enzyme based cloning is a recombinant vector cloning process that uses complementary nucleotide sequences in both the insert genetic material and the cloning vector with a recombination enzyme to directly create a recombinant vector"@en ;
                                             rdfs:label "recombination enzyme based cloning" .


