                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A support vector machine is a data transformation with a class prediction objective based on the construction of a separating hyperplane that maximizes the margin between two data sets of vectors in n-dimensional space."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "James Malone" ,
                                                                                          "Ryan Brinkman" ;
