                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "PMID: 19336255. RNA-Seq-quantitative measurement of expression through massively parallel RNA-sequencing. Wilhelm BT, Landry JR.Methods. 2009 Jul;48(3):249-57." ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "is a DNA sequence which is manufactured by Illumina (Solexa) corporation. it support sequencing of single or paired end clone libraries relying on sequencing by synthesis technology"@en ;
