                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A planned process in which a subject receives an informed consent document and agrees that they have understood it."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "09/28/2009 Alan Ruttenberg. There's a need for a general process like this in IAO - document and person in, signed document (and associated obligations, rights, out" ;
