                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A binding assay where the specified output determines if two or more material entities do or do not have the disposition to form a complex above a threshold level of significance. The threshold can be defined through detection limits of the instrument, the use of experimental controls that establish what is considered significant binding, or a predefined cutoff based on what binding is considered significant in a certain context."@en ;
