                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Determination of a 3D structure of an antibody binding a protein by X-Ray crystallography, which identifies the specific binding site of the antibody." ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120> ;
