                                                               owl:someValuesFrom <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000001>
                                                             ] ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "genetic characteristics information"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "a data item that is about genetic material including polymorphisms, disease alleles, and haplotypes."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Person: Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "MO_66 IndividualGeneticCharacteristics"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000232> """MO definition:
The genotype of the individual organism from which the biomaterial was derived. Individual genetic characteristics include polymorphisms, disease alleles, and haplotypes.

examples in ArrayExpress
wild_type
MutaMouse (CD2F1 mice with lambda-gt10LacZ integration)
AlfpCre; SNF5 flox/knockout
p53 knock out
C57Bl/6 gp130lox/lox MLC2vCRE/+
fer-15; fem-1
df/df
pat1-114/pat1-114 ade6-M210/ade6-M216 h+/h+ (cells are diploid)"""@en ;
                                             rdfs:label "genetic characteristics information"@en .


