                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "an information content entity that has been generated by a prediction process in which an estimate of a value of an entity is made which can be measured but without performing such a measurement. The value specification is intended to be close to the value a measurement process would produce modulo a prediction error."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Bjoern Peters" ;
