                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "a material entity that is the specified output of an addition of molecular label process that aims to label some molecular target to allow for its detection in a detection of molecular label assay"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Matthew Brush" ;
