                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "biodiversity assessment objective is an objective of a planned process aimed at producing data item whose interpretation should provide insight about variety of biological species found in a biological sample at macroscopic or microscopic level"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Philippe Rocca-Serra"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PRS for OBI"@en ;
