                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A binding assay that identifies protein-binding sites on nucleic acids by selecting high-affinity target ligands from a randomized pool. The process is repeated in rounds, then the bound nucleic acids are separated from the unbound nucleic acids and amplified by PCR._"@en ;
