                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An extracellular electrophysiology assay where a collection of microelectrodes (often in an 'array' configuration) is placed into neural tissue to measure the distribution of voltage and current changes for a population of cells over time."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Gully Burns" ;
                                             rdfs:label "multi-unit recording" .


