###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002586
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002586> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_0001300> ,
                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
