                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "site-directed mutagenesis" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Site-directed mutagenesis was used to prepare mutants of the Hypoxia-inducible factor-1 (HIF-1) alpha subunit to investigate the role of certain amino acids in hypoxia. (PMID:12393189)" ;
