###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002620
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002620> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001154> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "random mutagenesis" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Error-prone PCR was used to introduce amino acid mutations to the cAMP receptor protein (CRP) of E. coli to investigate strain engineering to improve osmotolerance for industrial requirements. (PMID:22179860)" ;
