###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002674
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0002674> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0500000> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "case series study design" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "PMID: 22213493" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A study design that samples only subjects who have experienced a particular event (outcome or exposure). Such a design, in contrast to a cohort study, does not permit calculation of absolute risk as non-case subjects are not included."@en ;
