                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "Oxford Nanopore GridION Mk1" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Nineteen libraries were constructed and sequenced on nineteen different R9.4 FlowCells using the GridION X5 sequencer" ;
