                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A categorical value specification in which the available categories were created with an explicit order."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> """https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ordinal_data provides references for follow-up, but more than one OBI developer has objected to \"...whose levels have natural, ordered categories and the distances between those categories is not known...\"

