                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "snATAC-seq can be used to dissect heterogeneity and delineate gene regulatory sequences in complex tissues, and uncover both the cell types and the regulatory elements in each cell type without prior knowledge." ;
