                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An ATAC-seq assay in which single nuclei are isolated from frozen tissue samples, through a protocol designed to maximally preserve nucleus integrity during sample processing and optimize transposase-mediated fragmentation of chromatin in individual nuclei."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Mark Andrew Miller, ORCID:0000-0001-9076-6066" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "snATAC-seq" ;
