                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An arthropod trap that is manufactured by Biogents and is designed to attract arthropods through the use of a motorized fan to mimic convection currents produced by a human. The current also pulls arthropods into the trap, where a layer of gauze prevents the arthropods from escaping along with the air current."@en ;
