                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A type of DNA sequencing assay employing in situ chromatin profiling in which a chromatin protein is bound in situ by a specific antibody, which then tethers to a protein A-Tn5 hyperactive transposase fusion protein (pA-Tn5) loaded with sequence adapters. Activation of pA-Tn5 results in factor-targeted tagmentation, generating fragments ready for PCR enrichment and DNA sequencing."@en ;
