                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "directed mutagenesis" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Exons 20 and 21 were targeted for deletion because they encode the signature and Walker B motifs of the first ATP-binding domain, elements that are known to be critical for ABCA1 function. PMID:15550377" ;
