                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "We have generated a WMS mouse model with S236X mutation in ADAMTS10 which is similar to the R237X mutation identifiedin WMS patients using CRISPR-Cas9. PMID:30060141" ;
