                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "An endonuclease mediated mutagenesis in which guide RNAs and cas are used to introduce a mutation at a specific location in the genome."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Equivalent (narrow match) to FlyBase term \"CRISPR/Cas9\" (FBcv:0003008, narrow match as the OBI term covers all forms of cas) in the origin of mutation branch and Dd mutagenesis method term \"CRISPR/Cas9\" (DDMUMET:0000025)." ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Susan Bello ORCID:orcid.org/0000-0003-4606-0597" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "CRISPR mediated mutagenesis" ,
