                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A transgenic mutagenesis that produces a mutation by introducing a construct designed to monitor transcriptionally active regions when inserted into the genome of an organism by inserting a reporter gene that requires cis-acting DNA sequences in the genome to activate reporter gene expression."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Susan Bello ORCID:orcid.org/0000-0003-4606-0597" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "url:https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17877761/" ;
                                             rdfs:label "enhancer-trap mutagenesis" .


