                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "To disrupt the mdr1a gene a 1.6 kb NheI genomic fragment containing exons 6 and 7 was replaced by a hygromycin phosphotransferase cassette in a targeting vector. PMID:7910522" ;
