                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A Hi-C assay in which the sample that is sequenced is derived from a collection of cells, such as a tissue sample or entire cell culture, and therefore provides results representative of the aggregate of sample cells."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Michelle Giglio" ,
