                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A cell based DNA damage assay that uses several constructed bacterial strains to detect mutations."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "The bacterial strains were originally constructed by Bruce Ames.  Each carries a mutation in a gene involved in histidine synthesis.  The cell requires histidine for growth but cannot produce it. The assay measures the creation of mutations that result in a return of function so that the cells can grow on a histidine-free medium." ;
