                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "EM is a probabilistic algorithm used to estimate the maximum likelihood of parameters from existing data where the model involves unobserved latent variables. The input to this method is the data model for which the estimation is performed over and the output is an approximated probability function."@en ;
