                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A replicate analysis is a data transformation in which data from replicates are combined, e.g. through descriptive statistics calculations, and the results might be utilized for a variety of purposes, like assessing reproducibility, identifying outliers, normalizing, etc."@en ;
