                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Gating is a property-based vector selection with the objective of partitioning a data vector set into vector subsets based on dimension values of individual vectors (events), in which vectors represent individual physical particles (often cells) of a sample and dimension values represent light intensity qualities as measured by flow cytometry."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "James Malone"@en ,
