                                                                                          "PERSON: Monnie McGee"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000232> "From Monnie's file comments - need to add moment_calculation and center_calculation roles but they don't exist yet - (editor note added by James Jan 2008)"@en ;
                                             rdfs:label "arithmetic mean calculation"@en .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0200080
