                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A data transformation that takes as input data that describes biological networks in terms of the node (a.k.a. vertex) and edge graph elements and their characteristics and generates as output properties of the constituent nodes and edges, the sub-graphs, and the entire network."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Richard Scheuermann"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "network topology analysis" ;
