                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "The polynomial degree is a feature of a polynomial function defined as the highest power of the polynomial's terms, where the terms of a polynomial are the individual summands with the coefficients omitted."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Elisabetta Manduchi" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PERSON: Elisabetta Manduchi" ;
                                             rdfs:label "polynomial degree"@en .


