                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A generalized FWER correction method is a multiple testing procedure that controls the probability of at least k+1 false positives, where k is a user-supplied integer."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Monnie McGee" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "gFWER correction"@en ;
