                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A quantile proportion of false positives correction method is a multiple testing procedure that controls the pth quantile of the distribution of the proportion of false positives among the rejected hypothesis (false discovery rate)."@en ;
