                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "buffer role" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "A buffer of carbonic acid (H2CO3) and bicarbonate (HCO3-) is present in blood plasma, to maintain a pH between 7.35 and 7.45. http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buffer_solution" ;
