                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "asphyxiation is a process by which oxygen supplies are restricted (by mechanical, e.g obstructing airways or chemical means, e.g. increasing CO2 partial pressure) resulting in termination of life in oxygen reliant organisms."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "Philippe Rocca-Serra" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "OBI branch" ;
                                             rdfs:label "asphyxiation"@en .


