###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400005
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400005> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400008> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "A10-Analyzer" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A A10 is a flow_cytometer_analyser manufactured by Apogee. It uses an arc lamp as a light source, with choices of 75W Xe, 75W Xe/Hg or 100W Hg arc lamps. It has filters and collectors for up to three fluorescent parameters and two scatter parameters. It uses analog electronics. The A10 can be used for measuring the properties of individual cells."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "John Quinn" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "http://www.apogeeflow.com/flow_cytometry_products.htm" ;
                                             rdfs:label "A10-Analyzer" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400006
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400006> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400008> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "A40-MiniFCM" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A A40-MiniFCM is a flow_cytometer_analyser that allows for the choice of one of four lasers (375nm, 405nm,488nm, 532nm, 635nm), and PMTs and filters for collecting up to four parameters. It uses digital electronics. A military version of this cytometer is available as well. The A40-MiniFCM is geared towards the most demanding applications such as archaea, bacteria and large virus."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "John Quinn" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "http://www.apogeeflow.com/flow_cytometry_products.htm" ;
                                             rdfs:label "A40-MiniFCM" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400007
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400007> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_0001300> ,
