                                             rdfs:label "Guava Personal Cell Analysis" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400051
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400051> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0400008> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "Guava Personal Cell Analysis-96" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "The Guava_Personal_Cell_Analysis-96 Systems is a flow_cytometer_analyser that includes a single 532 nm laser, and filters and PMTs to collect up to 2 fluorescent parameters. It includes a photodiode forward scatter collector. Guava cytometers use aspiration instead of fluid systems to transport cells within the machine. The PCA96 uses either tubes or 96 well plates to introduce specimen. The Guava PCA -96 cytometer is a small portable cytometer particularly useful for field measurement."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "John Quinn" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "Guava_PCA-96" ;
