                                                             ] ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "microscope" ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "PMID:18466942. A light and transmission electron microscope study of hepatic portal tracts in the rhesus monkey (Macacus rhesus). Tissue Cell. 2008 May 6" ;
