                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A protocol application in which an organism is intentionally put to death"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "difficult to place this properly - JG. Death process (e.g. unscheduled death) is out of scope but should be added somewhere. All killings have death process as a part, but not all death processes are part of a killing."@en ;
