                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "cell fixation"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "http://www.tissuearray.org/CellLinesProtocolforTMA112.pdf; the treatment of CD8+ cells with methanol at -20oC; http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/entrez?cmd=Retrieve&db=PubMed&amp;list_uids=16080188&dopt=AbstractPlus"@en ;
