                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "a protocol application to preserve defined  qualities of cells or tissues (sample) which may otherwise change over time"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "should include capturing what qualities are being preserved"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Bjoern Peters"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "OBI branch derived"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000232> "we could generalize this for other input materials"@en ;
                                             rdfs:label "cell fixation"@en .


