                                                               owl:someValuesFrom <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000456>
                                                             ] ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000111> "addition of molecular label"@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "The addition of phycoerytherin label to an anti-CD8 antibody, to label all antibodies. The addition of anti-CD8-PE to a population of cells, to label the subpopulation cells that are CD8+."@en ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000125> ;
                                             <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "a material processing technique intended to add a molecular label to some input material entity, to allow detection of the molecular target of this label in a detection of molecular label assay"@en ;
